# Security

## Secrets

- Never print or commit secrets. Use `.env.local` locally; GitHub secrets/vars + CF Secrets in deploy.
- `NOCODB_API_TOKEN`, `TURNSTILE_SECRET` / `TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY`, `REVALIDATE_SECRET` = server-only.
- `NOCODB_BASE_URL` may be a GitHub **variable**; still avoid baking tokens into the client bundle.

## Turnstile (`turnstile.md`)

- Do not create a new widget; do not manage widgets via CF API unless asked.
- Siteverify: `https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/siteverify` — require `success === true`.
- Add `data-action="turnstile-spin-v2"` on every `cf-turnstile` node.

## Revalidate

- Gate `/api/revalidate` on `REVALIDATE_SECRET` (self-generated hex). Fail closed on mismatch.
- Configure NocoDB webhooks only after tables exist.

## Preview

- `preview.qrbni.dev`: noindex, nofollow, no sitemap promotion, SEO fully off.
